{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_shards", "label": "ClusterSharding.shards", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The coordinator owns the shard map but not the entity counts, so the call fans out to every registered region and joins the answers against the allocation map \u2014 one extra round trip. Shards with no home are missing from the list because nobody asked for them."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardinfo", "label": "ShardInfo", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Carries a live ref, not just placement data, so one query answers both 'what is out there' and 'how do I talk to it' \u2014 the price is that ShardInfo is not JSON-serialisable. It is a snapshot: entityCount was true when the region answered and node holds only until the next rebalance."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_resident_flag", "label": "ShardInfo.resident flag", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Separates a shard that is running and momentarily empty from one that was passivated empty \u2014 entityCount: 0 reports both. Reachability is unaffected: the ref works either way."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_partial_answer_deadline", "label": "Partial-answer fan-out deadline", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A region that is too slow or left between map snapshot and fan-out contributes entityCount: 0 instead of failing the whole call \u2014 a complete shard list with a conservative number beats an exception."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardreffor", "label": "ClusterSharding.shardRefFor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Placing a homeless shard is exactly what a first message would have done. It wakes a local shard immediately \u2014 a handle on a non-running actor would be a handle on nothing \u2014 while a remote shard is materialised by its owning region on the first tell."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_entityreffor", "label": "ClusterSharding.entityRefFor", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The message no longer carries its own routing key, so extractEntityId is never consulted; obtained synchronously because the shard is just hash(entityId) % numShards. Location-transparent via the local region, so a proxy region is enough to hand one out."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_ask_on_remote_shard_ref", "label": "ask on a remote shard ref times out", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "ask creates a one-shot reply ref with no place in the actor tree, so it is not addressable from another node. Send GetShardStats with your own actor's self as replyTo, or use shards(), whose answer the region routes home."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardmapchanged", "label": "ShardMapChanged", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fires on every node, not just the leader \u2014 the coordinator broadcasts to each region and the region publishes locally, which is what makes it usable for a per-node dashboard. Broadcasts are coalesced, so version counts broadcasts, not individual reassignments."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_getshardstats", "label": "GetShardStats", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_shards", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardinfo", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_resident_flag", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardinfo", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_partial_answer_deadline", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_shards", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardreffor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_getshardstats", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_ask_on_remote_shard_ref", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_getshardstats", "relation": "rationale_for", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_entityreffor", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_extractentityid", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_shardmapchanged", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_sharding_coordinator", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_shards", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_overview_shard_region", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/cluster/sharding/introspection.mdx", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_cluster_sharding_introspection_resident_flag", "target": "d